OL,3,AWhat we know so far after Polish gunman
OL,4,Aopens fire in Krakow main square
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage from the scene shows scenes of
OL,7,Fpanic as people fled, with the sound of
OL,8,Fgunfire clearly heard.
